       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MAINA.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-ONE           PIC 9(4) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           CALL 'HELPER' USING WS-ONE
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM MAINA.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. HELPER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TAB.
          05 WS-CELL       PIC X(8) OCCURS 10 TIMES.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LK-IDX           PIC 9(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-IDX.
           MOVE WS-CELL(LK-IDX) TO WS-CELL(1)
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM HELPER.
